=== HINT 1 ===
Replace the 0 on the right-hand side of each assignment with the correct expression.
Example:  int sum = a + b;

=== HINT 2 ===
Integer division in C truncates toward zero.
20 / 6  ==  3   (not 3.33...)
20 % 6  ==  2   (the leftover after dividing)

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
int sum        = a + b;
int difference = a - b;
int product    = a * b;
int quotient   = a / b;
int remainder  = a % b;
